<http://purl.org/www.umr-lastig.fr/geodata#BD_TOPO_V3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://purl.org/www.umr-lastig.fr/geodata#BD_TOPO_V3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#DatasetSeries> .
